SUMMARY:Cultural Immersion Saturday: India
DESCRIPTION:Each Saturday in May highlights a unique AANHPI culture\, with community partners taking the lead on experiences\, performances\, and vendors to showcase their heritage. \n\n\n\nJoin us Saturday\, May 16\, as Kalabharathi School of Dance brings us a full day honoring and celebrating Indian culture. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSchedule of Events\n\n\n\nTimeProgramDetails10:00 AM to 6:00 PMFood & Retail VendorsSilSila The Flaming TandoorIndian-Style Jewelry & Accessories Sale1:00 PMCultural PerformanceClassical Indian Dance Bharathanatyam Performance2:00 PMCulture CornerIndian Saree Dressing Demonstration2:30 PMCulture CornerKolam: Indian House Decorating3:00 PMCultural PerformanceClassical Indian Dance Bharathanatyam Performance\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMeet the Community Partner:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKalabharathi School of Dance is a premier dance institution and performance company dedicated to preserving and sharing the traditions of Bharatanatyam. Celebrating 29 years in Oregon\, it is an approved center for Bharatanatyam certification through APAA\, India. \n\n\n\nWith over 100 students\, Kalabharathi is known for its award-winning productions\, community collaborations\, and performances across Oregon and Washington. The school has also presented more than 29 Arangetrams over the past 15 years\, supporting students in reaching important milestones in their artistic journey. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nParking & Directions\n\n\n\nFree Lan Su Parking\n\n\n\nThere is free first come\, first served parking in our sister lot next to the garden at 424 NW Third Avenue. Additional metered parking and garages are available on surrounding streets.
URL:https://lansugarden.org/event/cultural-immersion-saturday-india/
LOCATION:Lan Su Chinese Garden\, 239 NW Everett Street\, Portland\, Oregon\, 97209
CATEGORIES:AANHPI Heritage Month,Free with admission or membership
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lansugarden.org/wp-content/uploads/Kalabharathi-School-of-Dance-group-1200x800-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
